@page
@model AboutUsModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}



<head>
    <style>

        body {
            background-image: url("images/lightmoon.png");
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-size: cover;
        }

        .aboutusContainer {
            margin: 5% 0 0 10%;
        }

            .aboutusContainer h4 {
                font-size: x-large;
                letter-spacing: 5px;
                margin-left: -10px;
                color: orange;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                text-decoration: underline;
            }

            .aboutusContainer h1 {
                color: coral;
                font-size: 28px;
                margin: 20px 0 2px -15px;
              
              
            }

            .aboutusContainer h5 {
                color: coral;
                font-size: 18px;
                font-style: italic;
                margin-top: -8px;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
                margin-left: -15px;
            
            }

            .aboutusContainer p {
                color: white;
                font-size: x-large;
            }

            .aboutusContainer h3 {
                color: darkorange;
                text-decoration: underline;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                font-size: xx-large;
            }

            .aboutusContainer ul li {
                list-style: none;
                font-size: 20px;
                margin-top: 10px;
                color: white;
            }

                .aboutusContainer ul li font {
                    color: darkorange;
                    margin-bottom: 5px;
                    text-decoration: underline;
                    font-size: 25px;
                    font-style: italic;
                }
    </style>
    
</head>

<body>

    <div class="aboutusContainer">


        <h4>About Us</h4>
        <h1>DISASTER AVELLIATION FOUNDATION</h1>
        <h5>Your angels when you are in need</h5>
        <p class="mb-4">

            We work to unite people with a common vision making a difference by serving mankind for ‘Greater Good’. We provide unconditionally assistance to the needy, irrespective of disaster cause, race, religion, colour, class, political affiliations or geographic
            location.


        </p>
        <h3><i class="fa fa-check text-success me-3"></i>OUR PRINCIPLES</h3>

        <p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <font>Humanity</font><br> Disaster Avelliation Foundation has a desire to bring assistance without discrimination to the wounded on the battlefield and endeavour preventing and alleviating human suffering wherever it may be found. Its
                    purpose is to protect life and health to ensure respect for the human being. We promotes mutual understanding, friendship, cooperation and lasting peace amongst all peoples.

                </li>
                <li>
                    <font>Impartiality</font><br> We makes no discrimination as to race, religious beliefs, class or political opinions. We endeavour to relieve the suffering of individuals, being guided solely by their needs, and to give priority to the
                    most urgent cases.

                </li>
                <li>
                    <font>Neutrality</font><br>In order to continue to enjoy the confidence of all, the foundation may not take sides in hostilities or engage at any time in controversies of a political, racial, religious or ideological nature.

                </li>

                <li>
                    <font>Voluntary</font><br> Service and donations are voluntary from our donors. Maintaining their confidentiality as per their wishes.

                </li>
                <li>
                    <font>Unity</font><br> We are open to all and carrying on our humanitarian work throughout our territory.


                </li>

            </ul>







        </p>
    </div>
</body>